]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them. In 2026 so far, the middle of the grids got 13% of normal in February to March and 31% in March to April. Grid 23521 had its driest year in 2002 at 44%. On grid 23220, the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 94.2.</p>"}
